        Autofill.

        These are the only strings in the app that appear on top of *another* app's window, so they
        say as little as possible about the vault. "Unlock Bubu Protect" over a bank login is already
        a sentence about the user; "3 saved logins for chase.com" would be a great deal more.
    -->
